["home/stop-pre-rinsing-dishes","Why It Backfires","Pre-rinsing dishes backfires because modern detergents need food soil to activate enzymes and the machine's sensors calibrate to actual soil levels: scrape, don't rinse, and the dishwasher performs better on less energy.","The enzyme story","Detergents bind to food soil; a clean plate starves them.","Sensor logic","Soil sensors decide cycle length from what they detect.","The scrape rule","Scraping is the only prep a modern machine needs.","Energy and water","Pre-rinsing doubles the kitchen's water for negative gain.","The exceptions","Baked-on and oversized loads still need a soak.","The manufacturer's advice","Every major manual says the same thing now.","The pre-rinse habit costs water and wash quality at once. Scrape instead and the machine does exactly the job it was engineered to do.","sports"],
["sports/how-the-olympics-work-explained","The Machinery Behind The Games","The Olympics run on three machines: the qualification system that selects athletes, the host-city contract that builds the venues and the broadcast economy that funds both. The machinery explains most of the Games' strange shapes.","Qualification","How athletes arrive: standards, quotas and the wild cards.","The host contract","The obligations that shape a decade of construction.","Broadcast economy","The money that actually funds the movement.","The programme fight","Which sports enter and leave, and why.","The two-week window","Scheduling physics across dozens of venues.","The legacy question","What remains when the flame goes out.","The Olympics are an institution with machinery you can inspect. Learn the three systems and the Games' oddities become design features.","tech"],
["tech/data-security-compliance-gdpr-ccpa-ndpr","The Three Regimes, Plainly","GDPR, CCPA and NDPR are three privacy regimes with one shared skeleton: notice, consent, access rights and breach duties. The plain-language comparison runs obligation by obligation, and the differences matter at the edges.","The shared skeleton","Notice, consent, access, deletion, breach: the common spine.","GDPR's edges","The strictest consent standard and its enforcement teeth.","CCPA's shape","Consumer rights dressed as opt-outs.","NDPR's local fit","Nigeria's regime and its practical requirements.","The small-team reality","What compliance costs before any lawyer bills.","Where to start","The five actions that cover most obligations.","Privacy compliance is three regimes sharing one skeleton. Learn the spine first and the jurisdictional edges stay manageable.","tech"],
